19
00:01:32.294 --> 00:01:38.731
A precise definition makes later examples
easier to evaluate and revise.

20
00:01:38.834 --> 00:01:45.505
With the foundation in place, examine how
Appearance Modeling operates in a concrete

21
00:01:45.505 --> 00:01:46.018
