35
00:02:54.274 --> 00:03:01.243
Using shared criteria turns a preference into
a defensible technical choice.

36
00:03:01.243 --> 00:03:08.598
Name each dependency explicitly, and keep
labels and representations consistent

37
00:03:08.598 --> 00:03:10.805
throughout the analysis.

38
00:03:10.922 --> 00:03:17.977
Apply Object Recognition to a worked situation
instead of treating it as an isolated

39
00:03:17.977 --> 00:03:18.481
definition.

40
00:03:18.481 --> 00:03:24.684
Object recognition maps visual evidence to
object hypotheses.

41
00:03:24.684 --> 00:03:31.767
Consider this worked case: A system identifies
a traffic sign by comparing edge patterns and

42
00:03:31.767 --> 00:03:37.434
