45
00:03:45.825 --> 00:03:50.481
The worked case shows both how to apply the
method and how to check it.

46
00:03:50.594 --> 00:03:57.946
Examine the tradeoffs in Scene Understanding,
including what improves and what becomes more

47
00:03:57.946 --> 00:03:58.512
