63
00:05:28.035 --> 00:05:35.457
Filtering combines neighboring samples to
smooth, sharpen, or detect structure.

64
00:05:35.457 --> 00:05:43.560
Consider this worked case: A Gaussian filter
smooths a noisy image to reduce high-frequency

65
00:05:43.560 --> 00:05:49.348
noise, and a SIFT detector extracts
scale-invariant keypoints for matching.

66
00:05:49.348 --> 00:05:56.914
Locate the first point where observed behavior
diverges from expected behavior, then test the

67
00:05:56.914 --> 00:05:58.535
smallest plausible cause.

68
00:05:58.535 --> 00:06:06.395
The diagnosis is strongest when another person
can reproduce the observation and the test.

69
00:06:06.506 --> 00:06:14.081
Connect Segmentation & Shape Analysis to the
earlier ideas and explain how the pieces work

70
00:06:14.081 --> 00:06:15.596
