71
00:06:15.596 --> 00:06:21.893
Segmentation assigns pixels or regions to
selected categories.

72
00:06:21.893 --> 00:06:29.877
Consider this worked case: A binary mask
isolates a vehicle from a background, and

73
00:06:29.877 --> 00:06:36.721
