boundary to a polygon for further analysis.

74
00:06:36.721 --> 00:06:45.855
Explain each connection explicitly and verify
that information retains the same meaning

75
00:06:45.855 --> 00:06:47.377
across representations.

76
00:06:47.377 --> 00:06:54.362
The synthesis matters only if every connection
remains supported by the original evidence.

77
00:06:54.482 --> 00:07:01.522
Finish with Evaluation & Robustness as a
practical checklist that can guide a new

78
00:07:01.522 --> 00:07:02.025
analysis.

79
00:07:02.025 --> 00:07:09.557
Evaluation tests sensitivity to viewpoint,
lighting, occlusion, and data shift.

80
00:07:09.557 --> 00:07:17.021
Consider this worked case: A detection model
is tested across different camera angles and

81
00:07:17.021 --> 00:07:22.353
